---
const tiles = Array.from({ length: 30 }, (_, i) => i);
---
<figure class="map" data-reveal-group>
  <div role="img" aria-label="Diagram: thirty micro-frontend tiles all resolve shared modules from one runtime through an import map">
    <div class="tiles">{tiles.map((i) => <span class:list={['tile', { 'tile--accent': i % 7 === 0 }]} data-step style={`--i: ${i % 10}`}></span>)}</div>
    <span class="line" data-step="grow" style="--i: 11"></span>
    <pre>{`{ "imports": {
    "react":         "/runtime/react.js",
    "@platform/ui":  "/runtime/ui.js"
} }`}</pre>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Fig. 1 — Every micro-frontend asks for shared modules by name; one import map answers for all of them. (Illustrative.)</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .map { margin: 0; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(10, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  .tile { height: 26px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper); }
  .tile--accent { background: var(--accent); }
  .line { display: block; width: 2px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: top; }
  pre { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font: 400 14px / 1.6 ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font: 400 14px var(--font-ui); color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
</style>
